      "message": "The dilemma comes from tcpci_tcpm_drv. tcpci_tcpm_drv has to have a chip-specific version of get_fw_version, which varies board to bard.\n\nWe can remove \u0027const\u0027 from tcpm_drv and install a chip specific get_fw_version to a tcpm_drv on board init or something. What exactly are you suggesting?",
